न तदस्ति विना यत्स्यान्मया भूतं चराचरम् ॥ ३९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3099,\"bb\":2739,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/39/b2739/\",\"body_value\":\"yac cāpi sarva-bhūtānāṁ
bījaṁ tad aham arjuna
